        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marc Silverstein, Katherine Fugate, Abby Kohn, Garry Marshall\n- Works: Never Been Kissed, He's Just Not That Into You, How to Be Single, Valentine's Day\n- Topics: American screenwriters, romantic comedy films\n\nFacts:\n- Marc Silverstein was born on July 1, 1971.\n- Marc Silverstein is an American screenwriter.\n- Marc Silverstein is known for co-writing the romantic comedy films Never Been Kissed, He's Just Not That Into You, and How to Be Single.\n- Marc Silverstein is known for contributing to the story for the romantic comedy film Valentine's Day.\n- Valentine's Day is a 2010 American romantic comedy film.\n- Garry Marshall directed Valentine's Day.\n- Katherine Fugate, Abby Kohn, and Marc Silverstein wrote the screenplay and the story for Valentine's Day.",
